                          "text":  "Then, two and a half years later, I had visitors. Apollo 12 landed close enough to walk over. Pete Conrad and Alan Bean looked me over, cut off my camera, my scoop and a few other pieces, and took them home so engineers could see what years on the Moon had done.\n\nSo part of me went back to Earth. The rest of me is still here in my crater. Not many robots can say that people came to visit.",
